[I] An OpenGL to PostScript printing library

[T] GL2PS is a C library providing high quality vector output for any
[T] OpenGL application. It uses sorting algorithms capable of handling
[T] intersecting and stretched polygons, as well as non-manifold objects,
[T] and provides advanced smooth shading and text rendering, culling of
[T] invisible primitives and mixed vector/bitmap output. It can produce
[T] PostScript, EPS, PDF and SVG output.

[U] https://geuz.org/gl2ps/

[A] Christophe Geuzaine <cgeuzaine@uliege.be>
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/multimedia

[L] LGPL
[V] 1.4.2
